LOCUS       TAGGING_FIXTURE        5000 bp    DNA     linear   SYN 31-AUG-2026
DEFINITION  Synthetic single-gene locus for terminal and internal tagging tests.
ACCESSION   TAGGING_FIXTURE
VERSION     TAGGING_FIXTURE.1
KEYWORDS    synthetic; fixture; regression test.
SOURCE      synthetic construct
  ORGANISM  synthetic construct
COMMENT     1500 bp of flank precedes the ATG and 1800 bp follows the stop codon, so
            N-terminal and C-terminal designs can place 400 bp homology arms and
            still position validation primers wholly outside those arms.
            Fully synthetic - no reference, project or subject data.
